 "softening": "Resistance falls by 1 when the doctor validates feelings, explains why a question is asked, apologises or offers a choice; by 1 more after two calm turns in a row (toward the style's base); it is capped at 1 once trust reaches the style's softens_at_trust, where the base also drops to 0. It rises with judgement or threats (+2), and with interrupting, rushing or premature reassurance (+1). Range 0..3.",
